{"ID":"20240205153738-qn9m7hp","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153738-qn9m7hp","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153738-qn9m7hp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206094046-2hulok6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206094100-zhlbzjp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103556-qif99m2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:163,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:163\u0026#125;","title":"小茴香","type":"doc","updated":"20240902161922"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206103556-qif99m2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103556-qif99m2","updated":"20240206103558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t原产欧洲，我国主产于内蒙古、甘肃、四川等地。\n【性状】\t果实为双悬果，呈圆柱形，有的稍弯曲，两端略尖，长48mm，直径1.52.5mm。表面黄绿或淡黄色，顶端残留有黄棕色突起的柱基，基部有时有细小的果梗。分果呈长椭圆形，背面有纵棱5条，接合面平坦而较宽。横切面略呈5边形，背面的4边约等长。有特异茴香气，味微甜、辛。\n【性味】\t辛，温。\n【功效】\t开胃进食，理气散寒，有助阳道。主治：中焦有寒，食欲减退，恶心呕吐，腹部冷痛；疝气疼痛，睾丸肿痛；脾胃气滞，脘腹胀满作痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240206103550-028vq1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103550-028vq1h","updated":"20240206103550"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206103550-svh6oq0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205161935-3whvu2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205161935-3whvu2l","updated":"20240724105110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小茴香"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小茴香-20240205161935-siw8517.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 408px;","style":"width: 398px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小茴香 (20)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小茴香 20-20240724105110-u3r4eju.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 398px;\" parent-style=\"width: 408px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724104549-u6hnicd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724104549-u6hnicd","updated":"20240724104602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 504px;","style":"width: 494px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小茴香 (14)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小茴香 14-20240724104549-6k8hjz4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 494px;\" parent-style=\"width: 504px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 749px;","style":"width: 739px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小茴香 (15)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小茴香 15-20240724104602-3j4nlqj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 739px;\" parent-style=\"width: 749px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724103954-hpjooly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724103954-hpjooly","updated":"20240724104124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 681px;","style":"width: 671px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data